Scope workspace availability cache per user to prevent permission leakage.

Under long-running PHP runtimes (FrankenPHP worker mode, RoadRunner,
ReactPHP, ...) cache.runtime survives across requests. The
workspace-service-available-workspaces cache key has no user
parameterization, so user A populates the cache and user B sees
workspaces they lack permission for.

Include the backend user UID in the cache key. Under PHP-FPM
nothing changes (the runtime cache dies with the process).

--- a/Classes/Service/WorkspaceService.php
+++ b/Classes/Service/WorkspaceService.php
@@ -107,7 +107,9 @@
      */
